<%# locals: (count:) -%>
<%# The app's badge on its icon (the Badging API): how many cards wait on the person, in all their workspaces, as
    Needs you lists them (User#needs_you). Re-broadcast whenever a card starts or stops waiting (Invocation), so every
    open page keeps it right. -%>
<%# The phone app shows the same count on its Needs you tab, named by its id among the tabs Rails serves
    (PathConfiguration::TABS), and on its icon (native/tab_badge_controller). -%>
<span id="app_badge" hidden data-controller="badge native--tab-badge" data-badge-count-value="<%= count %>" data-native--tab-badge-tab-value="needs-you"></span>
